msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_RETURN_TO_LAUNCH"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:244
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:287
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:399
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:644
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:682
#: 074c72d1ff034527bc26551207970a3e 30bc7a48db0c4169a30fe9f44ad71740
#: 7bf5020d8008401cb04796a67d905085 9c8d314176454cd59bbdd96bdcfb86b0
#: ad5b7813779c4203b0e8909513b9a0cb d6eed8cc125343b5b68c07704d4ccdc1
msgid ""
"Return to the *home location* or the nearest `Rally Point <common-rally-"
"points>`__, if closer. The home location is where the vehicle was last armed"
" (or when it first gets GPS lock after arming if the vehicle configuration "
"allows this)."
msgstr ""
"返回 *Home 位置*，或返回最近的 `集结点 <common-rally-points>`__ （如果更近）。Home "
"位置是飞行器最后一次解锁的位置（如果飞行器配置允许，则为解锁后首次获得 GPS 锁定的位置）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:653
#: a30bcecb64b74758a681fc324f2b5a9a
msgid "Copter"
msgstr "Copter"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:655
#: 58ce43c357724c2cbd7038e898bda366
msgid ""
"Return to the *home location* (or the nearest :ref:`Rally Point <common-"
"rally-points>` if closer) and then land. The home location is where the "
"vehicle was last armed (or when it first gets GPS lock after arming if the "
"vehicle configuration allows this)."
msgstr ""
"返回 *Home 位置*（或最近的 :ref:`集结点 <common-rally-points>`，如果更近），然后降落。Home "
"位置是飞行器最后一次解锁的位置（如果飞行器配置允许，则为解锁后首次获得 GPS 锁定的位置）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:659
#: 70f926754035486bbe2717e3f65a3c9d
msgid ""
"This is the mission equivalent of the :ref:`RTL flight mode <copter:rtl-"
"mode>`.  The vehicle will first climb to the :ref:`RTL_ALT <copter:RTL_ALT>`"
" parameter's specified altitude (default is 15m) before returning home."
msgstr ""
"此指令等同于 :ref:`RTL 飞行模式 <copter:rtl-mode>`。飞行器将先爬升至 :ref:`RTL_ALT "
"<copter:RTL_ALT>` 参数指定的高度（默认为 15m），然后返回 Home。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:664
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:704
#: 1a3e20cffd7f4172bed6961b40a40188 e97b64d6e109440fb728165b6edaddcb
msgid ""
"This command takes no parameters and generally should be the last command in"
" the mission."
msgstr "此指令不需要任何参数，通常应作为任务的最后一条指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:722
#: 9a243ea2695f49689b62a1557667974b
msgid "Copter: Mission PlannerSettings for RETURN_TO_LAUNCH command"
msgstr "Copter：RETURN_TO_LAUNCH 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:735
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:765
#: 1f11150c1b664b45be9dfabf497393e8 ad037aef5c0749aab2fba49789d0b2bd
msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_LAND"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_LAND"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:741
#: cd0ba03a2ac143259c887907de48bde9
msgid ""
"The copter will land at its current location or proceed at current altitude "
"to the lat/lon coordinates provided (if non-zero) and land.  This is the "
"mission equivalent of the :ref:`LAND flight mode <copter:land-mode>`."
msgstr ""
"飞行器将在当前位置降落，或以当前高度飞往指定的经纬度坐标（如果非零）并降落。此指令等同于 :ref:`LAND 飞行模式 <copter:land-"
"mode>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:745
#: 7ee8c0b3f9e7481a98a89ea132c2df65
msgid ""
"The motors will not stop on their own: you must exit AUTO mode to cut the "
"engines."
msgstr "电机不会自动停止：必须退出 AUTO 模式才能关闭电机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:803
#: 106763251ebe4d4dbe286d7c0e086df7
msgid "Copter: Mission Planner Settings for LAND command"
msgstr "Copter：LAND 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:819
#: d175049f60ac4e5abdf91cc39de7499b
msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_SPLINE_WAYPOINT"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_SPLINE_WAYPOINT"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1506
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2783
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2850
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2916
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:821
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:902
#: 38bff64ac57847ff9baa4d3ccb2ebc5e 52ddc4128876488491abec2151be1f13
#: 5403c68d177d41808cd25917a6fc9692 6e98b8207a6a411493a6af0488347479
#: aa0962b6ceab4f5eb617bb994478e402 f0e44d2fc93546ca939f8ab9bc6b3fd7
msgid "Supported by: Copter (not Plane or Rover)."
msgstr "支持的飞行器：Copter（不含 Plane 或 Rover）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:823
#: 8cb51f5da10d479b900eec66f672a476
msgid ""
"Fly to the target location using a `Spline path "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spline_%28mathematics%29>`__, then wait "
"(hover) for a specified time before proceeding to the next command."
msgstr ""
"使用 `样条曲线路径 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spline_%28mathematics%29>`__ "
"飞往目标位置，然后等待（悬停）指定时间后继续执行下一条指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:826
#: b7205191a8fc4711a077a416f805f449
msgid ""
"The Spline commands take all the same arguments are regular waypoints (lat, "
"lon, alt, delay) but when executed the vehicle will fly smooth paths (both "
"vertically and horizontally) instead of straight lines. Spline waypoints can"
" be mixed with regular straight-line waypoints as shown in the screenshot "
"below."
msgstr ""
"样条指令与普通航点使用相同的参数（纬度、经度、高度、延迟），但执行时飞行器将沿平滑路径飞行（垂直和水平方向均如此），而非沿直线飞行。样条航点可与普通直线航点混用，如下方截图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:884
#: 56258a1c98614cd4a2939f7544dd1fa2
msgid "Copter: Mission Planner Settings for SPLINE_WAYPOINT command"
msgstr "Copter：SPLINE_WAYPOINT 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:886
#: 6799642e34004222833fec85b5fd5519
msgid "The Mission Planner screenshot shows the path the vehicle will take."
msgstr "Mission Planner 截图显示了飞行器将要飞行的路径。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:888
#: 4b45a1d0194142deb757b8fc2a17e3db
msgid ""
"The 1 second delay at the end of Waypoint #1 causes the vehicle to stop so "
"Spline command #2 begins by taking a sharp 90degree turn"
msgstr "航点 #1 末尾的 1 秒延迟导致飞行器停止，因此样条指令 #2 从急转 90 度开始"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:890
#: fbf1a514b8a040a28bd4de95f6c3a333
msgid ""
"The direction of travel as the vehicle passes through Spline Waypoint #3 is "
"parallel to an imaginary line drawn between waypoints #2 and #4"
msgstr "飞行器经过样条航点 #3 时的飞行方向与航点 #2 和 #4 之间的假想连线平行"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:892
#: 03c00b343b404797bf78c926e6b7fc4d
msgid ""
"Waypoint #5 is a straight line so the vehicle lines itself up to point "
"towards waypoint #5 even before reaching waypoint #4."
msgstr "航点 #5 是直线，因此飞行器在到达航点 #4 之前就已经开始朝向航点 #5 方向对齐。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:900
#: eaf49c678c954f9d80d4c0cba4cb497b
msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_GUIDED_ENABLE"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_GUIDED_ENABLE"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:904
#: 4570a9e8103b4416a1a46671954b5213
msgid ""
"Enable ``GUIDED`` mode to hand over control to an external "
"controller/:ref:`common-companion-computers`. ee :ref:`Guided Mode "
"<copter:ac2_guidedmode>` for more information. The :ref:`common-companion-"
"computers`  would then send MAVLink commands to control the vehicle."
msgstr ""
"启用 ``GUIDED`` 模式，将控制权移交给外部控制器/:ref:`common-companion-computers`。详情请参阅 "
":ref:`Guided 模式 <copter:ac2_guidedmode>`。:ref:`common-companion-computers` "
"随后将发送 MAVLink 指令来控制飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:906
#: 93722b55636643e183ed1b3ca5db334c
msgid ""
"See also :ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_GUIDED_LIMITS <mav_cmd_do_guided_limits>` for "
"information on how to apply time, altitude and distance limits on the "
"external control."
msgstr ""
"另请参阅 :ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_GUIDED_LIMITS "
"<mav_cmd_do_guided_limits>`，了解如何对外部控制设置时间、高度和距离限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1111
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:279
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:322
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:492
