#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1045
#: 2bfe6c6c3f4844d5a62bf9e8d5a8f056
msgid ""
"After reaching this waypoint, the vehicle will descend up to the maximum "
"descent value. If the payload has not touched the ground before this limit "
"is reached, the vehicle will climb back up to the waypoint altitude and "
"continue to the next mission item. If it reaches the ground, it will "
"automatically release the gripper if enabled, and optionally wait a period, "
"re-grip, and ascend back to the waypoint altitude and continue the mission. "
"Numerous parameters that control the payload touch-down detection, wait "
"period, etc. are prefaced with ``PLDP_``."
msgstr ""
"到达此航点后，飞行器将下降至最大下降值。如果在到达此限制前负载未接触地面，飞行器将重新爬升至航点高度并继续执行下一条任务项。如果接触地面，将自动释放抓手（如果启用），可选择等待一段时间，然后重新抓取并爬升回航点高度继续任务。控制负载触地检测、等待时间等的众多参数均以"
" ``PLDP_`` 为前缀。"

