#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1508
#: c60a6b1a5a7f41ca854a9b90d434973f
msgid "Point (yaw) the nose of the vehicle towards a specified heading."
msgstr "将飞行器机头（偏航）指向指定航向。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1510
#: 85f4a28aa435469f9d6ffc7838ddbf8c
msgid ""
"The parameters allow you to specify whether the target direction is absolute"
" or relative to the current yaw direction. If the direction is relative you "
"can also (separately) specify whether the value is added or subtracted from "
"the current heading (note that the vehicle will always turn in the direction"
" that most quickly gets it to the new target heading regardless of the "
"``param3`` value)."
msgstr ""
"参数允许您指定目标方向是绝对方向还是相对于当前偏航方向。如果方向是相对的，您还可以（单独地）指定该值是加到还是减去当前航向（注意飞行器始终会以最快的方式转向新目标航向，而不管"
" ``param3`` 的值）。"

