msgid "Supported by: Copter"
msgstr "支持的飞行器：Copter"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1595
#: f43cef9ef3714c4e9b3c53de559149e2
msgid ""
"This command can be used to start a mission when the Copter is on the ground"
" in AUTO mode. If the vehicle is already in the air then the mission will "
"start as soon as you switch into AUTO mode (so this command is not "
"needed/ignored). This allows a GCS/companion computer to start a mission in "
"AUTO without raising the throttle."
msgstr ""
"当 Copter 在地面处于 AUTO 模式时，此指令可用于启动任务。如果飞行器已在飞行中，切换到 AUTO "
"模式后任务将立即开始（因此此指令不需要/被忽略）。这允许地面站/伴飞计算机在不拉高油门的情况下以 AUTO 模式启动任务。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1603
#: a8143f7b81fe4811a194ba6b6b68d364
msgid ""
"Previously a mission would only start after the pilot engaged the throttle. "
"This command makes it possible to start missions without directly "
"controlling the throttle (though that approach is still available)."
msgstr "以前，任务只能在飞手操作油门后才能启动。此指令使得在不直接控制油门的情况下启动任务成为可能（尽管那种方式仍然可用）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1608
#: d7d5d424a2f7406c80763da133bc5b02
msgid ""
"This is not a \"mission command\" (it can't be used as a type of mission "
"waypoint). It is run from the **Action** menu (see the screenshot below)."
msgstr "这不是「任务指令」（不能作为任务航点类型使用）。它从 **动作** 菜单运行（见下方截图）。"

