"interrupt (switching modes).  A full explanation of this feature can be "
"found on the :ref:`Mission Rewind on Resume Page <common-mission-rewind>`.  "
"After setting a rewind distance in a mission, setting the distance to zero "
"will switch off the rewind feature from that point on the mission."
